<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, and in 2025 it came in at 41%. September to October was not much better in 2025 at 50%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, and grid 13381 got just 51% of normal that year.</p>"}
